<title>MALAYSIA: Cagamas accepts 3-yr bonds at average 6.871 pct.</title>
<headline>Cagamas accepts 3-yr bonds at average 6.871 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's national mortgage corporation Cagamas Bhd said on Thursday it accepted bids at an average yield of 6.871 percent at its auction of three-year fixed rate bonds for 375 million ringgit.</p>
<p>Total amount bidded for the bonds was 1.46 billion ringgit, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>With the new issuance, the total amount of Cagamas bonds and notes outstanding in the market stood at 17.72 billion ringgit, Cagamas said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
